(7532658, 1204629, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the focus on that one half.  I''d have flipped the image horizontally, so the eye is not disappointed by not seeing the first half one so out of focus.<br/> <br/>Flipped, you''d see the in focus one first... and then be able to enjoy the perfect DOF.</td>', 'I love the focus on that one half.  I''d have flipped the image horizontally, so the eye is not disappointed by not seeing the first half one so out of focus. Flipped, you''d see the in focus one first... and then be able to enjoy the perfect DOF.', '2017-09-02 17:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532659, 1204392, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp.  Love the textures and colors.</td>', 'Nice and sharp.  Love the textures and colors.', '2017-09-02 17:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532660, 1204915, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see this without the strong processing.  It''s superbly set up and the composition is beautiful.</td>', 'I''d love to see this without the strong processing.  It''s superbly set up and the composition is beautiful.', '2017-09-02 17:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532661, 1204957, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love all of this except the blown whites on the mushrooms.   The colors and details are fun to explore.</td>', 'I love all of this except the blown whites on the mushrooms.   The colors and details are fun to explore.', '2017-09-02 17:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532662, 1204877, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely array of color and veggies!</td>', 'Lovely array of color and veggies!', '2017-09-02 17:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532663, 1204339, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the textures here.<br/> <br/>I don''t love the flowers.  I agree that you needed something tallish in the cool bucket... but I wish it were something else.<br/> <br/>Yup.  I''m that picky.  Ha!<br/> <br/>This should score well since the lighting on the pears on the right is so lovely.<br/> <br/>Oh!<br/> <br/>I think if you''d only had the pears on the right and the empty bucket... that would have worked even better!</td>', 'I love the textures here. I don''t love the flowers.  I agree that you needed something tallish in the cool bucket... but I wish it were something else. Yup.  I''m that picky.  Ha! This should score well since the lighting on the pears on the right is so lovely. Oh! I think if you''d only had the pears on the right and the empty bucket... that would have worked even better!', '2017-09-02 18:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532664, 1204890, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the BW on the fruit, since I assume the colors are beautiful.  Also, the blown whites are extremely distracting to me.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the BW on the fruit, since I assume the colors are beautiful.  Also, the blown whites are extremely distracting to me.', '2017-09-02 18:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532665, 1204942, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish this were in color so I could enjoy the lovely light better.</td>', 'I wish this were in color so I could enjoy the lovely light better.', '2017-09-02 18:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532666, 1204916, 86447, '<td valign="top">The colors and details are great!   But... the arrangement leaves me bored.<br/> <br/>I think it should be more random... instead of so perfectly arranged.<br/> <br/>Something to cause a bit of dissonance to the viewer and keep them interested.</td>', 'The colors and details are great!   But... the arrangement leaves me bored. I think it should be more random... instead of so perfectly arranged. Something to cause a bit of dissonance to the viewer and keep them interested.', '2017-09-02 18:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532667, 1204755, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fabulous DOF.  and that bug just tops this off nicely!</td>', 'Fabulous DOF.  and that bug just tops this off nicely!', '2017-09-02 18:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532668, 1204670, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hahahahahaha!</td>', 'Hahahahahaha!', '2017-09-02 18:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532669, 1204463, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nice "in your face" fruit... great detail... good lighting.  I''d have taken off the sticker, though.</td>', 'Nice "in your face" fruit... great detail... good lighting.  I''d have taken off the sticker, though.', '2017-09-02 18:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532670, 1204944, 86447, '<td valign="top">Winner.<br/> <br/>Lovely.<br/> <br/>If I want to nitpick, I''ll say that the lower left leaf seems to "placed"... but I don''t want to nitpick, so I won''t say it.  :D<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-09-09 20:34:42.</i></td>', 'Winner. Lovely. If I want to nitpick, I''ll say that the lower left leaf seems to "placed"... but I don''t want to nitpick, so I won''t say it.  :D', '2017-09-02 18:08:18.000000', '2017-09-09 21:34:42.000000', 1),
