(7532673, 1204918, 86447, '<td valign="top">No... This doesn''t make me want to eat them.<br/> <br/>The processing is too harsh for me to enjoy.</td>', 'No... This doesn''t make me want to eat them. The processing is too harsh for me to enjoy.', '2017-09-02 18:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532674, 1204531, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love that plate/bowl!   <br/> <br/>I also love the colors of the fruit and knife with the bowl.<br/> <br/>In my opinion, putting it on a solid white or black background... or wood, leaving out the upper bowl of fruit, and upping the focus/sharpness on the remaining fruit would make this first place in my book.<br/> <br/>As it is, the background overcomes the cool arrangement and colors that you have with the plate and three gorgeous fruits.</td>', 'I love that plate/bowl!    I also love the colors of the fruit and knife with the bowl. In my opinion, putting it on a solid white or black background... or wood, leaving out the upper bowl of fruit, and upping the focus/sharpness on the remaining fruit would make this first place in my book. As it is, the background overcomes the cool arrangement and colors that you have with the plate and three gorgeous fruits.', '2017-09-02 18:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532675, 1204778, 86447, '<td valign="top">Stunning.   Tied for first in my opinion.<br/> <br/>Cant think of a thing to improve upon.</td>', 'Stunning.   Tied for first in my opinion. Cant think of a thing to improve upon.', '2017-09-02 18:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
